{
  "family": "contract",
  "module": "player/engine-contract.js",
  "note": "The web <-> native contract, protocol v1 (docs/native-engine-plan.md §5; player/engine-contract.js, NE-11j): the closed names, and every valid and invalid example of player/parity/schema/engine-contract.schema.json except the snapshot's, as contractAccepts(kind, payload). Swift's decoding (NE-11s, NE-20) must accept and refuse the same payloads.",
